# CHANGELOG.md is append-only under `## [Unreleased]`, and AGENTS.md requires every
# PR to add an entry there. Two PRs adding bullets is therefore not a real
# conflict, but git stops on it anyway. `union` keeps both sides.
#
# Line-based, not section-aware: at release time, skim the `## [Unreleased]`
# block in case a bullet landed under an adjacent heading. See RELEASING.md.
# GitHub does not read this file, so its own merge and squash-conflict
# detection are unaffected; this helps the local `git merge origin/main`.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
